---
const calendlyUrl = "https://calendly.com/gawen-francois/audit-perte-de-temps-gflux";
---

<section id="offre" class="section-padding bg-black border-t border-bento-border relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Interactive-like background gradient (AI tech feel) -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-tech-blue/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] -z-0 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container-narrow relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <div class="reveal badge bg-white border border-deep-tech/10 text-text-secondary mb-6 shadow-sm">
        Next Steps
      </div>
      <h2 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-5">
        Prêt à <span class="text-tech-blue">accélérer</span> ?
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Offer Box (Tech Style) -->
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="relative bg-surface rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-bento-border overflow-hidden bg-clip-padding backdrop-filter backdrop-blur-xl">
        <!-- Glow top edge -->
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-tech-blue/50 to-transparent"></div>

        <div class="bg-surface-alt px-6 py-4 text-center border-b border-bento-border relative">
          <p class="text-text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase text-xs font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            Audit de processus IA gratuit
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 md:p-10 relative">
          <!-- Glassmorphic Guarantee -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-8 p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-bento-border shadow-[inset_0_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)]">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1 text-white">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-white text-lg mb-2">
                Sans risques
              </h3>
              <p class="text-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-sm">
                Pas de bullshit. Si nous ne détections pas un potentiel d'<strong class="text-white">au moins 5h/semaine</strong> économisables, nous vous laissons le rapport tel quel.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What you get -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Premium Glass Box -->
      <div class="reveal relative rounded-3xl bg-surface border border-bento-border p-8 md:p-12 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <!-- Tech Blue Top Edge Glow -->
        <div class="absolute top-0 inset-x-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-tech-blue/80 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-[100px] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[400px] h-[200px] bg-tech-blue/20 blur-[80px] pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="text-center relative z-10 mb-10">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-tech-blue/30 bg-tech-blue/10 text-tech-blue text-sm mb-6 mb-4 font-medium shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(27,127,248,0.15)]">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
            Sans engagement de durée
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-4">
            L'audit d'automatisation IA.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light">
            Une analyse chirurgicale de vos processus. Nous plongeons dans votre entreprise pour dénicher les heures perdues.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-tech-blue" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"></path></svg>
              Livrables concrèts
            </h3>
            {[
              "Cartographie de vos flux inefficaces",
              "Estimation précise des heures récupérables",
              "Cahier des charges pour un Agent IA pilote",
              "Plan de déploiement sécurisé"
            ].map(item => (
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-muted">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-mustard flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                <span class="text-sm font-light">{item}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- Garantie Block -->
          <div class="bg-mustard/5 border border-mustard/20 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-mustard/10 blur-[40px] pointer-events-none"></div>
            <h3 class="text-mustard font-semibold mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
              Garantie de Résultat
            </h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Nous cherchons uniquement les victoires écrasantes. Si nous ne pouvons pas d'ores-et-déjà identifier un minimum de <strong class="text-white">5 heures d'économies par semaine</strong> pour votre équipe, nous arrêtons là et ne vous vendons rien. Zéro perte de temps.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
          <a href={calendlyUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-10 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white bg-tech-blue rounded-md overflow-hidden transition-transform shadow-[0_4px_30px_rgba(27,127,248,0.4)] hover:bg-blue-600 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-tech-blue/50 w-full md:w-auto">
            <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2">
              Planifier l'Audit Gratuit
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-text-muted flex items-center gap-1.5 font-light">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            15 min • Visioconférence
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
